# Rosetta's Garden of Keys — repo hygiene
#
# Most of this portfolio is hand-written HTML with no build step, so there is
# very little to ignore.  The exception is seasonal/, which carries a Vite
# project: its node_modules is ~93 MB and must never reach GitHub, while its
# built single-file page must, because Pages has no build step of its own.

# dependencies
node_modules/

# build caches and tooling scratch
.vite/
.tmp.driveupload/
*.tsbuildinfo

# NOTE: dist/ is deliberately NOT ignored.  seasonal/.../dist/thresholds-index.html
# is the deployable — without it the atlas is dead on GitHub Pages.

# local machine-specific Claude Code settings (launch.json is shared on purpose)
.claude/settings.local.json

# logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# OS and editor cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.swp
*~

# secrets — nothing in this repo should ever need them, but belt and braces
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
